"click. This process ensures that your Google Sheet reflects the latest coupon "
"information, following the configuration set above. Benefit from real-time "
"insights and streamlined data management. Before starting the sync, confirm that "
"the coupons tab toggle is enabled enhancing your workflow with the convenience of "
